+	* index.html (TF_VERSION): 1.7.  (header comment): The 1.7 line and
+	who made ?load=.
+	(loadFromQuery): New; boot() calls it last.  Reads ?load=, resolves it
+	against the page, refuses file: and any other origin with a toast
+	before any request is made, then fetches with same-origin
